<title>ROMANIA: Romania c.bank cuts refinancing offer, rate.</title>
<headline>Romania c.bank cuts refinancing offer, rate.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's central bank (BNR) said on Thursday it had reduced the one-week refinancing funds on offer to 300 billion lei from 500 billion.</p>
<p>It also said it had also cut the minimum permitted rate to 205 percent from 220 percent last week.</p>
<p>Traders said short-term rates, which traded near 215/18 percent on a fairly liquid money market, might start to edge down next week.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
